    "body": "Yup, just confirmed it works with LF.\r\n\r\n```\r\nxmr@xmr-PC /c/Users/xmr/Desktop/html-build\r\n$ export PATH=/C/Perl/perl/site/bin:/C/Perl/perl/bin:/C/c/bin:$PATH\r\n\r\nxmr@xmr-PC /c/Users/xmr/Desktop/html-build\r\n$ ./build.sh\r\nChecking if html-build is up to date...\r\nLooking for the HTML source (set HTML_SOURCE to override)...\r\nFound /c/Users/xmr/Desktop/html (alongside html-build)...\r\nBuild tools have been updated since last run; clearing the cache...\r\nDownloading caniuse data...\r\nDownloading list of W3C bugzilla bugs...\r\nPre-processing the source...\r\n\r\nLocal wattsi is not present; trying the build server...\r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n100 11.5M    0 4313k  100 7518k  34238  59680  0:02:09  0:02:09 --:--:--     0\r\nParsing caniuse.com data...\r\nProcessing caniuse.com data...\r\nParsing bugs data...\r\nParsing...\r\nGenerating HTML variant...\r\nGenerating DEV variant...\r\n\r\nSuccess!\r\n\r\nxmr@xmr-PC /c/Users/xmr/Desktop/html-build\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnly the linter keeps failing for me on Windows:\r\n\r\n```\r\nLinting the source file...\r\n\r\nTrailing whitespace:\r\n2: !   EDITOR NOTES\r\n6: !    - descriptions of the element's categories\r\n12: !    - element, attribute, content model, and interface indexes\r\n15: !    - The IDL and content attributes for the relevant elements\r\n16: !    - element and attribute indexes\r\n...\r\nall lines\r\n```",
